    "Lume Cloud sent a response this version of Lume can’t read. Update Lume to resume syncing." : {
      "comment" : "Sync error when the Lume Cloud server response can't be decoded; suggests updating the app. Lume Cloud is a product name; keep it in Latin script.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أرسل Lume Cloud استجابة لا يستطيع هذا الإصدار من Lume قراءتها. حدّث Lume لاستئناف المزامنة."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud hat eine Antwort gesendet, die diese Version von Lume nicht lesen kann. Aktualisiere Lume, um die Synchronisierung fortzusetzen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud sent a response this version of Lume can’t read. Update Lume to resume syncing."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud ha enviado una respuesta que esta versión de Lume no puede leer. Actualiza Lume para reanudar la sincronización."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud a envoyé une réponse que cette version de Lume ne peut pas lire. Mettez à jour Lume pour reprendre la synchronisation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud ha inviato una risposta che questa versione di Lume non riesce a leggere. Aggiorna Lume per riprendere la sincronizzazione."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloudから、このバージョンのLumeでは読み取れない応答が返されました。同期を再開するにはLumeをアップデートしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lume Cloud가 이 버전의 Lume에서 읽을 수 없는 응답을 보냈습니다. 동기화를 재개하려면 Lume을 업데이트하세요."
