    "Paste an API key you generated in Dispatcharr. Lume never creates or replaces keys." : {
      "comment" : "Dispatcharr sign-in sheet: footer below the API key field. Dispatcharr is a product name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الصق مفتاح API أنشأته في Dispatcharr. لا ينشئ Lume المفاتيح ولا يستبدلها أبدًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füge einen API-Schlüssel ein, den du in Dispatcharr erstellt hast. Lume erstellt oder ersetzt nie Schlüssel."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Paste an API key you generated in Dispatcharr. Lume never creates or replaces keys."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pega una clave de API que hayas generado en Dispatcharr. Lume nunca crea ni sustituye claves."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collez une clé d’API générée dans Dispatcharr. Lume ne crée ni ne remplace jamais de clés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incolla una chiave API che hai generato in Dispatcharr. Lume non crea né sostituisce mai le chiavi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dispatcharr で生成した API キーを貼り付けてください。Lume がキーを作成したり置き換えたりすることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dispatcharr에서 생성한 API 키를 붙여 넣으세요. Lume은 키를 생성하거나 교체하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Plak een API-sleutel die je in Dispatcharr hebt aangemaakt. Lume maakt of vervangt nooit sleutels."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wklej klucz API wygenerowany w Dispatcharr. Lume nigdy nie tworzy ani nie zastępuje kluczy."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cole uma chave de API gerada no Dispatcharr. O Lume nunca cria nem substitui chaves."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вставьте API-ключ, созданный в Dispatcharr. Lume никогда не создает и не заменяет ключи."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dispatcharr'da oluşturduğunuz bir API anahtarını yapıştırın. Lume hiçbir zaman anahtar oluşturmaz veya değiştirmez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
